WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.760
Aviation moves forward through pioneers.

00:06.760 --> 00:12.360
People who saw possibilities found the path and built the future.

00:12.360 --> 00:19.560
Airports enter a new era, using AI to connect rules, funding, approvals, contracts and

00:19.560 --> 00:21.560
facts.

00:21.560 --> 00:26.280
That intelligence has a name, TarmacSync.

00:26.280 --> 00:31.920
It brings the pieces together, revealing the likely path, what needs attention and the

00:31.920 --> 00:37.520
next move, while every decision remains yours.

00:37.520 --> 00:42.960
No airport should make a multi-million dollar decision flying blind.

00:42.960 --> 00:45.000
The path is yours to choose.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.400
TarmacSync helps you see it.

00:47.400 --> 00:52.600
Explore the Founding Airport Partner Program at TarmacSync.com.

